OL,11,G0306 Outlook
OL,12,     FWhen Rikki Stein first heard Fela
OL,13,     FKuti's music he was in the back of
OL,14,     Fa car and felt awestruck. Just a
OL,15,     Ffew years later Rikki was managing
OL,16,     FFela and the pair had become close
OL,17,     Ffriends.
