OL,5,G0350 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1997, scientists set out to
OL,7,     Ffind a cave in Tsavo, Kenya,
OL,8,     Fbelieved to have once been the den
OL,9,     Fof the man-eating lions that
OL,10,     Fterrorised Indian and African
OL,11,     Frailway workers in 1898.
